</svg>
      </div></button><code><pre><span class="function-name">Boolean</span>(<span class="number">0</span>) <span class="comment">// false</span></pre></code></div><a class="anchor-hash" href="#binary" style="display: flex; place-items: center;"><h3 id="binary"><span>Binary</span></h3></a><p><span>The binary primitive data type is useful for storing binary data. Some common forms of binary data are image data and video data. You can use one of the </span><code>TypedArray</code><span> constructors to create binary data types.</span></p><div class="code-viewer"><button class="copy-button"><div class="copy-icon">
<svg width="1055" height="1043" viewBox="0 0 1055 1043" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M650 242.266C732.843 242.266 800 309.423 800 392.266V892.266C800 975.108 732.842 1042.27 650 1042.27H150C67.1575 1042.27 0.000263959 975.108 0 892.266V392.266C0 309.423 67.1573 242.266 150 242.266H650ZM200 392.266C172.386 392.266 150 414.652 150 442.266V842.266C150 869.88 172.386 892.266 200 892.266H600C627.614 892.266 650 869.88 650 842.266V442.266C650 414.652 627.614 392.266 600 392.266H200Z" fill="black"/>
