</svg>
      </div></button><code><pre><span class="comment">// Uint8Array is a TypedArray constructor</span>
<span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="function-name">Uint8Array</span>([<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">3</span>])</pre></code></div><p><span>In practice, you usually won't use constructors when working with binary data. Instead, you would access the binary data through an API.</span></p><div class="code-viewer"><button class="copy-button"><div class="copy-icon">
<svg width="1055" height="1043" viewBox="0 0 1055 1043" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
