</svg>
      </div></button><code><pre><span class="variable-declaration-keyword">const</span> fileReader <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="function-name">FileReader</span>()
fileReader<span class="property-accessor">.</span>onload <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="function-keyword">function</span> (event) {
  <span class="comment">// event.target.result is binary data</span>
}
fileReader<span class="property-accessor">.</span><span class="function-name">readAsArrayBuffer</span>(myFile)</pre></code></div><a class="anchor-hash" href="#symbol" style="display: flex; place-items: center;"><h3 id="symbol"><span>Symbol</span></h3></a><p><span>The symbol primitive data type represents unique and </span><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Immutable"><span>immutable</span></a><span> values, and is primarily used as identifiers for object properties.</span></p><div class="code-viewer"><button class="copy-button"><div class="copy-icon">
<svg width="1055" height="1043" viewBox="0 0 1055 1043" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M650 242.266C732.843 242.266 800 309.423 800 392.266V892.266C800 975.108 732.842 1042.27 650 1042.27H150C67.1575 1042.27 0.000263959 975.108 0 892.266V392.266C0 309.423 67.1573 242.266 150 242.266H650ZM200 392.266C172.386 392.266 150 414.652 150 442.266V842.266C150 869.88 172.386 892.266 200 892.266H600C627.614 892.266 650 869.88 650 842.266V442.266C650 414.652 627.614 392.266 600 392.266H200Z" fill="black"/>
