<span class="comment">// promise2 is a promise returned from promise1.then(...)</span></pre></code></div><p><span>The promise's </span><code>.catch</code><span> method catches any errors rejected from a promise.</span></p><div class="code-viewer"><button class="copy-button"><div class="copy-icon">
